  "summary": "The saved mask (C26:L85-L93) comes from hot = Xt >= thr[doyT-1] per sea cell (C26:L58-L67), where thr.npy is the C13 cumsum-based wrap smoothing of per-doy Hazen percentiles over pools built from the C9 membership matrix on the C6 baseline cube. Because the cumulative sum makes each smoothed doy depend on all earlier padded entries, target doys 153-244 draw on raw days 352-366 and 1-259, i.e. baseline dates Dec 12 - Sep 20 of each year; all 92 target days feed the comparison and the sea-cell test."
